store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971420/extras/767b99356623964f85d2bec28801c0ae.poster.avif?t=1759831999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971420/extras/767b99356623964f85d2bec28801c0ae.webm?t=1759831999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971420/extras/767b99356623964f85d2bec28801c0ae.mp4?t=1759831999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or face off in an epic <strong>boss showdown</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer, your crew splits into two roles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subjects</strong> fight to survive and beat the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scientists</strong> sabotage their every move\u2014stacking the odds with roadblocks, extra notes, and deadly traps.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971420/extras/4565ffef7dab90ff4b3765eeb57404d4.poster.avif?t=1759831999\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971420/extras/4565ffef7dab90ff4b3765eeb57404d4.webm?t=1759831999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971420/extras/4565ffef7dab90ff4b3765eeb57404d4.mp4?t=1759831999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the subjects push through to victory, or will the scientists crush them before they can escape?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971420?t=1759831999","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971420?t=1759831999","capsule_image":"https://shar